ar categories mirroring the principles of Nonviolent Communication. The examples will demonstrate Kevyn\u0027s connection to his feelings and needs, rather than focusing on his actions. I\u0027m focusing on the Giraffe moments, which are empathy, gratitude, active listening, and taking responsibility for his expectations.\n\n\n",
