roach. I\u0027m prioritizing five key steps: filtering communication by size and frequency, avoiding future-oriented interrogations, embracing her silence without pressure, respecting physical and emotional limits without guilt-tripping, and establishing the \"Rule of Silence\" for his own self-care. I am ensuring that these are practical and grounded in real-world application.\n\n\n",
